        "code": {
          "text": "Health anxiety with excessive cancer worry, repeated checking, online searching, and reassurance seeking"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-1",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-1",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left breast ultrasound"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Performed approximately 6 weeks ago. 9 mm simple anechoic cyst in the left upper outer quadrant with a thin wall, no solid components, and no abnormal axillary nodes. Right breast NAD. BI-RADS 2; radiologist recommended no further imaging. No prior breast imaging for comparison."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Patient-reported left breast lump"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Self-palpated a left breast lump approximately 6 weeks ago; ultrasound identified a simple cyst."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left breast pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent ache around the cyst, especially premenstrually; currently described as a mild twinge, not severe. Settles with simple analgesia and warm packs."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Reported breast and systemic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies nipple discharge, skin change, new lumps, weight loss, night sweats, and fevers."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Cancer worry and checking behavior"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Marked worry that the breast cyst could be cancer. Reports daily breast palpation, sometimes feeling it is bigger, while acknowledging that it varies with her cycle and how hard she presses. Reports spending hours online reading about breast cancer and repeatedly asking whether MRI or further tests are needed."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Sleep and mental health symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sleep mildly impacted by rumination. No depressive features volunteered today; no suicidal ideation reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Patient-reported fatigue and hormone concern"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Briefly reports feeling generally tired and wonders whether there is a hormone imbalance; further assessment deferred to a separate consultation."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance on telehealth video"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Well appearing, alert, and in no apparent distress. Normal colour; no obvious pallor or jaundice."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Respiratory appearance on telehealth video"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Speaking in full sentences; no audible wheeze or shortness of breath."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Affect and speech on telehealth video"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Anxious and tearful at times, especially when discussing cancer; speech clear and coherent."
      }
    },
    {
